Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.24,0:00:03.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You might win an extra item!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.98,0:00:08.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am strongly considering holding\Na Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.66,0:00:10.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, but you're too close!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.70,0:00:12.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.61,0:00:13.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Back off there, Munami!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.53,0:00:14.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sorry, sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.12,0:00:16.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So hear me out.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:19.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all the new refugees in the\Nvillage, the populations exploded.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.56,0:00:22.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought we should do something to\Nbuild strong relationships with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.48,0:00:23.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And then it hit me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.54,0:00:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why don't we hold a huge festival\Nand invite the entire town?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.48,0:00:28.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That led me to another idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.52,0:00:30.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I call it the Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:32.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a good idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.44,0:00:34.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The eating contest we\Nheld was a big success,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.64,0:00:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and this will serve as a\Ndiversion, a much needed one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.66,0:00:39.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Might be eat, not ice. Yeah, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.96,0:00:42.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am going to need your\Nhelp to pull it off, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.18,0:00:45.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll pay you one, no, two gold coins.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.72,0:00:48.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You see, I was thinking\Nthat for the grand prize,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.08,0:00:50.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we could reward the champion with\N50 of their favorite products?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.68,0:00:52.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,from you free of charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.20,0:00:53.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.12,0:00:55.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At that point, I'd still\Nfinish way up in the black.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.38,0:00:57.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to refuse.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.56,0:00:58.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.72,0:01:00.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.54,0:01:01.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're the real MVP.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.94,0:01:03.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.02,0:01:06.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shirley will be a top contender.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.86,0:01:08.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, she surely will.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.20,0:01:11.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She has the looks, and she's used\Nto getting public attention, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.42,0:01:12.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.26,0:01:15.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're talking like you won't compete.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.44,0:01:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you will if I have a say in it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.88,0:01:20.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no way I'm competing.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.90,0:01:22.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want to either.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.20,0:01:23.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm way too shy. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.58,0:01:27.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if I threw in a week's worth\Nof free meals to sweeten the deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.20,0:01:28.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That does sound nice.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.82,0:01:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'm a no no matter what you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.68,0:01:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, don't you wanna see what\Nthese girls can do, Boxo?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.44,0:01:35.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.35,0:01:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now you're putting this on me?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.76,0:01:37.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's not cool, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.06,0:01:39.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the right way to respond?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.60,0:01:40.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Should I say yes or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:43.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like the kind of situation\Nwhere I'm screwed either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.68,0:01:44.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think, man, think.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.14,0:01:45.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.24,0:01:49.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There, that's vague enough\Nto be taken either way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.46,0:01:50.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.37,0:01:51.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean yes or no?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.52,0:01:53.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, be more specific, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.98,0:01:54.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.94,0:01:58.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fine, guess it's not good to be too pushy.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.54,0:02:00.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But consider this, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.36,0:02:03.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If Shirley wins, she'll\Nget 50 items from Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.34,0:02:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so overcome with emotion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.78,0:02:08.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I might just grab Boxo\Nand give him a passionate
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.14,0:02:10.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,kiss right on the glass of his front side.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.80,0:02:13.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or so she was saying.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.46,0:02:15.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But you two are not in. Got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.74,0:02:17.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.65,0:02:19.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, my dear sweet llamas?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.16,0:02:20.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.07,0:02:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess I will enter the Dungeon\NGoddess Grand Prix after all!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.12,0:02:27.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so Lamas has decided to enter.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.68,0:02:30.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You are really popular\Naround here, you know,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.24,0:02:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so that could make you a top contender.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.50,0:02:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Munami's enjoying this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.20,0:02:35.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What about you, Hulemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.82,0:02:38.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not that you have to feel\Npressured or anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.20,0:02:39.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, well, I...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.86,0:02:41.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Evil.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.77,0:02:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, fine, I'll enter, I guess. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.02,0:02:47.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.18,0:02:52.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, yes, because lately I've been\Ndeveloping a magic item of attraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.82,0:02:54.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Entering could be useful for that process.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.76,0:02:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You know, for research purposes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:59.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So then the both of you\Nare participating, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.36,0:03:02.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Things have taken an interesting turn.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.08,0:03:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeesh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.99,0:03:06.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's this sleazebag and what\Nhas she done with Munami?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.66,0:03:09.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bet that bit about\NShirley was a lie, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.32,0:03:13.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But hey, if they're both entering,\Nthey've got my full support.
Dialogue: 1,0:03:15.09,0:03:17.96,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.46,0:03:22.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the outside, I'm just a big metal box.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.74,0:03:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But inside, I've still got a human soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.96,0:03:27.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In this new world of\Nwonders, I travel to and fro!
Dialogue: 1,0:03:25.35,0:03:31.23,sign_1939_25_Reborn_as_a_Vend,title,0,0,0,,{\blur3\fad(773,1)\an8\fs20}Reborn as a Vending Machine,\N{\fnTimes New Roman\c&H020222&}I {\c&H161C79&}Now {\c&H1C379A&}Wander {\c&H1D6FE2&}the {\c&H2D9CED&}Dungeon
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.58,0:03:29.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,On the back of my super\Nstrong partner, Lamas.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.78,0:03:31.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The name's Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.24,0:03:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.26,0:03:34.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That means yes, by the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.86,0:03:49.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.86,0:04:49.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 1,0:04:51.52,0:04:54.98,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fad(734,1)\fscx100\fsp.7\pos(313,56)}The Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.12,0:04:54.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I love a festival.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.12,0:04:56.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's been so much fighting lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:04:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This will be a nice change of pace.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.04,0:05:00.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll be there for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.44,0:05:02.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, looking forward to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.36,0:05:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Says here it takes place in one week.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.66,0:05:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This looks like oodles of fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.64,0:05:08.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And rebuilding's going well.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.48,0:05:13.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Therefore, I feel it's only right that my\Ncompany should contribute to the cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.04,0:05:17.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm planning on taking\Npart in the Grand Prix.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.70,0:05:20.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Festivals like this really\Nare always so much fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.30,0:05:23.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I want to contribute to do\Nthe Clear Flow Locals proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.34,0:05:27.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, she won't be easy\Nto beat by any stretch.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.62,0:05:30.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Although I'd like to give my\Ntwo the upper hand somehow.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.30,0:05:33.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do I have some product that\Ncould help them win this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.32,0:05:36.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Welcome to the How to Win the Dungeon\NGoddess Grand Prix emergency meeting.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.04,0:05:37.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.04,0:05:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.04,0:05:43.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna get that Voxo gift\Ncertificate no matter what.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.24,0:05:44.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's bake this cookie, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.66,0:05:47.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems there will be\Nquite a few contestants.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.70,0:05:50.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So these three have\Ndecided to join forces.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.42,0:05:52.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, now let's talk logistics here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.80,0:05:55.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First, each contestant\Nwill introduce herself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.22,0:05:57.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The attire for that round\Nis everyday clothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.72,0:06:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But we should still put\Na lot of energy into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.18,0:06:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. Well, naturally.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.02,0:06:05.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next, we show off special skills,\Nbut the assignment is twofold.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.62,0:06:08.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have to demonstrate our skill\Nand appeal at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.60,0:06:10.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and we can wear whatever we like.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.30,0:06:12.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Special skills?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.64,0:06:13.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's archery for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.96,0:06:17.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, um, I guess I could pick\Nup some really heavy stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.48,0:06:19.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I could show off some of my inventions.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.02,0:06:23.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But what about... clothes?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:24.80,0:06:25.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's the rub.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.02,0:06:30.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I have besides this is my\Npajamas and boring casual stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.74,0:06:31.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, same here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.02,0:06:35.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I've never given much\Nthought to what I wear.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.14,0:06:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is such a sad conversation.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.30,0:06:39.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if we just made a few\Nslight alterations to the
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.84,0:06:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,clothes we're wearing now to\Nmake them show a bit more skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.56,0:06:44.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, yeah, I like that idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.44,0:06:46.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, get a grip.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.58,0:06:51.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you think you can beat Shirley\Nwhen it comes to showing skin?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.34,0:06:52.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't beat that!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.34,0:06:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In my personal opinion, they have a shot\Nif they compete in terms of natural beauty.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.12,0:07:00.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I think it'd be best\Nnot to expose too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.10,0:07:04.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, there's a shop here\Nin town that sells fabric.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.00,0:07:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I think there's still\Ntime for me to make something.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.74,0:07:09.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui, you can make clothes by hand?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.62,0:07:11.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The kids at the orphanage\Nhave always liked them,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.58,0:07:15.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Finding quality children's clothing in the\Ndungeon can be a real pain in the neck.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.48,0:07:18.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then we just have to come\Nup with some good designs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.28,0:07:20.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't ask me, I don't\Nthink I'd be good at that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.82,0:07:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I have no idea how to\Ndo any of that stuff either.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.90,0:07:25.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm good at children's clothes,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.34,0:07:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I wouldn't know where to begin\Nwith dressy outfits for adults.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:30.92,0:07:34.39,sign_Arial,text (yellow on blue),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H507E90&\3c&H4F594B&\shad0\bord4\fs15\fad(239,1)}Weekly Youth\N{\c&H2A3959&\3c&H556494&} Um... Would you like to join me? {\c&H757FAD&\3c&H424A7C&}Top new pin-ups!\N{\c&H5A5579&\3c&H372240&} Shonen {\c&H2F6681&}SteP
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.78,0:07:34.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, why'd you suddenly change shape?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:34.55,0:07:36.64,sign_Arial,text (lower right),0,0,0,,{\an7\c&H434358&\3c&H767888&\shad0\bord3\fad(279,1)}Weekly Youth\N{\c&H3C406C&} Everyone loves it!\N I want to copy it right now! How to dress SAILORS style.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.36,0:07:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is that?
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.64,0:07:37.85,sign_Georgia,text (top right; right page),0,0,0,,{\c&HB8A5B3&\3c&HDDADEE&\shad0\fs15\an9}Like it's the future\NA revolution in photo printing
Dialogue: 1,0:07:36.64,0:07:42.39,sign_Georgia,text (lower right; right page),0,0,0,,{\c&HB8B1B9&\3c&H78594C&\shad0\fs10\an9\pos(610,80)}This salty-sweet combo is both oversized and sporty.\N{\c&HB1B2A8&} Fresh and girly, a salty-sweet revolution of gaucho pants and sports jersey.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.88,0:07:39.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are some very pretty\Npictures in these books.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.68,0:07:42.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're wearing clothes I've never seen.
Dialogue: 1,0:07:39.89,0:07:42.39,sign_Arial,text (lower left),0,0,0,,{\an4\c&H627070&\bord3\shad0\fs15\3c&HB6E9E5&}An interview with\N SAILORS CEO Shizuka Miura!!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.16,0:07:43.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This outfit's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.50,0:07:47.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah, this sort of\Nthing could work. Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.76,0:07:49.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, look, this is cute, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.58,0:07:52.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is this what they wear\Nin the world box-os from?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.08,0:07:53.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.60,0:07:54.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I like this look.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.10,0:07:56.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This looks great!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.22,0:07:57.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would work on me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.74,0:07:58.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's lovely.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.66,0:07:59.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh, I like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.57,0:08:02.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had a feeling they'd lose\Nthemselves in this sort of thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.60,0:08:04.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that one just screams cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.38,0:08:05.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about this one?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:06.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.86,0:08:09.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, good work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.12,0:08:10.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Glad we have some kind of plan.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.12,0:08:14.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get going right away on our\Nwardrobe for the competition.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.14,0:08:14.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks, Shui.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.05,0:08:18.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we'll think up an idea for\Nyour archery demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.70,0:08:22.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been through a lot lately, so\NI'm just glad they're having fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.60,0:08:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As for what kind of outfits they've settled\Non, seems I'll find out on the day of.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.82,0:08:28.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hip, hip, hooray!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.68,0:08:33.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll have to see if I can come\Nup with some way to help, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.46,0:08:38.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The day has finally come for the Dungeon\NGoddess Grand Prix, or DGGP for short.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:38.84,0:08:41.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Clearflow Lake Stratum's\Nfestivals are amazing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.48,0:08:43.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never had this much\Nfun in my whole life!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.64,0:08:44.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Shui.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.94,0:08:45.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, hi!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.85,0:08:46.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good morning, Shui!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.77,0:08:47.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.68,0:08:49.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I got no sleep, but I managed\Nto finish the outfits.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.94,0:08:52.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui must have been up all night sewing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.42,0:08:53.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You poor thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.50,0:08:57.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But like we agreed, if any of the three\Nof us wins, we'll give the prize to you!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.30,0:08:58.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.21,0:08:59.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Truth be told, I don't see myself winning.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:00.04,0:09:02.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But if I manage to pull\Nit off, it's yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.30,0:09:03.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I appreciate it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.78,0:09:07.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Boxo, make some\Nnoise, okay? Psst! Eat you!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.92,0:09:09.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Aw, crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.28,0:09:12.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't even see the stage from here!
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.57,0:09:14.57,sign_Verdana,text (orange),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H000005&\3c&H468CF4&\shad0\fs15\pos(562,65)}Hunters Association
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.57,0:09:14.57,sign_Verdana,text (red),0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H1800DE&\3c&HFEFEFE&\shad0\fad(1984,1)\pos(451,84)\fs15\frz14.02}I'm here.
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.57,0:09:14.57,sign_Verdana,text (blue),0,0,0,,{\c&H18170C&\3c&HFEFEFE&\shad0\bord0\fad(1984,1)\fs15\pos(330,130)}Green room
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.57,0:09:14.57,sign_Verdana,text (green),0,0,0,,{\c&H18170C&\3c&HFEFEFE&\shad0\bord0\fad(1984,1)\fs15\pos(195,115)}Stage
Dialogue: 1,0:09:12.57,0:09:14.57,sign_Verdana,text (yellow),0,0,0,,{\c&H18170C&\3c&HFEFEFE&\shad0\bord0\fad(1984,1)\fs15\pos(74,129)}Audience
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.72,0:09:17.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And it'd be too much to move using the\Ncardboard vending machine and balloon combo.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.80,0:09:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, this is perfect\Nweather for a festival, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.18,0:09:23.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, but you can't see crap from there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.24,0:09:25.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How about I move you somewhere\Nwith better visibility?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.62,0:09:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that sound good?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.88,0:09:28.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.62,0:09:30.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Bear coming in clutch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.74,0:09:35.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you gotta be kidding me.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.08,0:09:37.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, Boxo's here too!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've sure been looking forward to today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.32,0:09:41.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too much, actually.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.68,0:09:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In fact, I've got dark\Ncircles under my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.22,0:09:47.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I see Director Dark is as\Ntalkative as ever, isn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.86,0:09:51.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speaking of talkative, you'll never\Nbelieve what happened to me yesterday.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.76,0:09:54.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've been working feverishly\Nto learn clear flow strategy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.44,0:09:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Dark on my left,\NDirector Labyrinth on my right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.86,0:09:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Worst surround sound ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.08,0:10:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you two chatterboxes\Nmind giving it a rest, please?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.06,0:10:04.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll be starting soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.60,0:10:07.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your judges and I want you both\Nto take that rule seriously.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.36,0:10:08.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.27,0:10:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heard and understood.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.40,0:10:10.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hear you, big guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.76,0:10:12.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise to give it my all.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whew. Thank goodness.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.10,0:10:16.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait, what am I doing here?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:19.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I figured I would invite\Nyou to be a judge too, Boxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.86,0:10:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director Origin was originally\Nsupposed to be on the panel,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.02,0:10:25.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but she had to back out\Nfor personal reasons.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.04,0:10:28.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And so Boxo got appointed instead?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.68,0:10:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I trust you'll be fair about it\Neven with your friends competing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.50,0:10:37.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm happy to know he has confidence\Nin me, but now I have to be a judge?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.86,0:10:39.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's a big responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.46,0:10:42.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.74,0:10:44.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We appreciate you being\Nsuch a patient crowd.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.06,0:10:45.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.18,0:10:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the first installment of the Clear Flow\NLake Stratum Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix.
Dialogue: 1,0:10:48.58,0:10:52.54,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(225,295)\fs25\c&H27A7EA&\3c&HD1F2FF&\shad0\fsp3.4\fad(443,1)\blur1}Emcee Munami
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.56,0:10:52.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who's the best girl, folks?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.78,0:10:55.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's go ahead and\Nmeet our participants.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.68,0:11:00.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First up, to start us off right,\Nit's Acowi from the Exchange House.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.00,0:11:03.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only thing I'm after\Nis that grand prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.02,0:11:06.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, as you all know, nothing's\Nbetter than free stuff.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.85,0:11:08.81,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\pos(210,295)\fs25\c&HCF3C96&\3c&HD1F2FF&\shad0\blur1\fad(443,1)\fscx52}Exchange House
Dialogue: 1,0:11:04.85,0:11:08.81,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs25\c&HCF3C96&\3c&HD1F2FF&\shad0\blur1\fad(443,1)\fsp6\pos(323,296)}Acowi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.46,0:11:09.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No strings attached is\Nthe best deal there is.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.82,0:11:13.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next is Thea, this lovely\Nlady from the item shop.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.82,0:11:17.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It turns out she was secretly very\Npopular among our male hunters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.30,0:11:19.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I hear there's been\Nlots of weeping and moaning
Dialogue: 0,0:11:19.88,0:11:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ever since she started\Ngoing out with Karios.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.45,0:11:25.32,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs25\c&H36BCF2&\3c&HD1F2FF&\shad0\blur1\fad(443,1)\fscx50\pos(223,291)}Item Shop
Dialogue: 1,0:11:21.45,0:11:25.32,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs25\c&H1CBBF2&\3c&HD1F2FF&\shad0\blur1\fad(443,1)\fsp6\pos(335,293)}Fia
Dialogue: 0,0:11:22.56,0:11:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, I promise to do the very best I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.04,0:11:27.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.02,0:11:31.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moving along, from the band of gluttons,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.60,0:11:33.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,she's quick on her paws\Nand has a big appetite.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.94,0:11:34.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here's Suco!
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.75,0:11:38.71,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs25\c&H563CE2&\3c&HD1F2FF&\shad0\blur1\fad(443,1)\fscx67\pos(223,291)}Band of Gluttons
Dialogue: 1,0:11:34.75,0:11:38.71,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs25\c&H573CDF&\3c&HD1F2FF&\shad0\blur1\fad(443,1)\fsp.7\pos(362,291)}Suco
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.85,0:11:38.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just want to win and get all the\Nfried chicken that a girl could want!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.92,0:11:40.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You got this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.30,0:11:42.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Number four!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.58,0:11:45.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She just entered yesterday,\Nwhich was a last-minute surprise.
Dialogue: 1,0:11:44.76,0:11:48.22,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\fs25\c&H563CE2&\3c&HD1F2FF&\shad0\blur1\fad(443,1)\fsp.4\pos(319,294)}Director Origin
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.60,0:11:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Director Origin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.80,0:11:53.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You look lovely, Director Origin!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.74,0:11:55.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't forget to smile!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.24,0:11:56.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know, you can do it!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.84,0:11:59.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, it looks the tail scaring!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.20,0:12:02.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you\Nexpected considering she only
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.32,0:12:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,entered the competition because\Nof your relentless bullying.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.20,0:12:07.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have no idea what you're talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.66,0:12:11.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, so that's why they needed\Nme to step in and be a judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.60,0:12:16.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This fine stratum is taking\Ngood care of my residents.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.94,0:12:21.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To show my gratitude, I thought I'd enter\Nthe competition and liven things up.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.06,0:12:23.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Director!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.97,0:12:24.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.89,0:12:25.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Direction!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.80,0:12:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now, our fifth entrance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.02,0:12:29.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's also donated the\Nprize for this Grand Prix.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.68,0:12:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's our very own girl boss, Suori.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.68,0:12:35.10,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs25\c&H27A7EA&\3c&HD1F2FF&\shad0\fscx64\fad(443,346)\blur1\pos(173,292)}Wealthy Merchant's Daughter
Dialogue: 1,0:12:30.68,0:12:35.10,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs25\c&H1CBBF2&\3c&HD1F2FF&\shad0\blur1\fad(443,346)\fsp6\pos(390,292)}Suori
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.98,0:12:34.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm here today to kick\Nbutt and win first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.02,0:12:36.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's make this a great contest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:39.12,0:12:42.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Number six, she's yet\Nanother adorable entrant.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.00,0:12:44.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Kiku Yu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.82,0:12:48.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll do my best.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.36,0:12:53.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Also, don't forget about all the fresh\Nvegetables I've got for sale over there.
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.53,0:12:52.37,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs25\c&HFCDF84&\3c&HFFFFE2&\shad0\fscx76\fad(443,1)\blur1\pos(227,291)}Snow Fairy
Dialogue: 1,0:12:48.53,0:12:52.37,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs25\c&HFDE275&\3c&HFFFFE2&\shad0\blur1\fad(443,1)\fsp1\pos(336,292)}Kikoyu
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.98,0:12:58.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, does everyone\Nhave a favorite girl so far?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.26,0:13:01.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, hold your horses, because there\Nare still some you've yet to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.88,0:13:06.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Number seven, it's our hunter\Nwith a stomach of steel, Shui!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.92,0:13:08.80,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs25\c&H57FF35&\3c&HD6FFD8&\shad0\fscx65\fad(443,346)\blur1\pos(160,293)}Stomach of Steel
Dialogue: 1,0:13:04.92,0:13:08.80,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs25\c&H62FF38&\3c&HD6FFD8&\shad0\blur1\fad(443,346)\fsp1.5\pos(299,293)}Shui the Hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.64,0:13:10.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,When I win, I'm gonna eat and\Neat and eat until I explode!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.24,0:13:11.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're down to the final three.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.00,0:13:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder, who could our\Nnext challenger be now?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.08,0:13:18.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Munami's starting to sound\Nlike this is a prize fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.38,0:13:21.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our brilliant magic item engineer, Hulemy!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.56,0:13:24.49,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs25\c&HDD459A&\3c&HD1F2FF&\shad0\fscx65\fad(443,346)\blur1\pos(174,293)}Magic Item Engineer
Dialogue: 1,0:13:20.56,0:13:24.49,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs25\c&HED45A8&\3c&HD1F2FF&\shad0\blur1\fad(443,346)\fsp6\pos(336,291)}Hulemy
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.16,0:13:24.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, girl, you feeling pumped?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.96,0:13:26.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am here, and that's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.26,0:13:31.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, for our penultimate powerhouse,\NThis girl's a favorite to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.74,0:13:34.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing slows down this super strong lady!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.68,0:13:36.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Lammis the Hunter!
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.25,0:13:38.62,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs25\c&H31E3F4&\3c&HD1F2FF&\shad0\fscx75\fad(443,1)\blur1\pos(85,288)}Super Strong and Full of Energy
Dialogue: 1,0:13:35.25,0:13:38.62,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\an1\fs25\c&H2DE1F6&\3c&HD1F2FF&\shad0\blur1\fad(443,1)\fsp.7\pos(356,288)}Lammis the Hunter
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.84,0:13:39.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.90,0:13:41.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promise to give it my best shot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.10,0:13:43.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.12,0:13:46.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't know Llamas was so popular.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.22,0:13:48.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the crowd is going crazy for her!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.86,0:13:52.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And at last, it's time\Nfor our final contestant!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.44,0:13:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Word on the street is\Nshe's the favorite to win!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.64,0:13:58.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the moment you've\Nall been waiting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.84,0:14:02.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Give it up for Shirley!
Dialogue: 1,0:14:01.98,0:14:05.90,sign_TrebuchetMS,text,0,0,0,,{\fs26\c&HA017D6&\3c&HFFD3FF&\shad0\blur1\fad(443,389)\fscx75\pos(321,286)}Shirley, the Favorite to Win (No Title Needed)
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.12,0:14:07.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone, deep breath. Ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.98,0:14:09.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now scream for me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.40,0:14:16.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's with this cheering?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.08,0:14:18.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's on another level.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.44,0:14:21.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will we be able to make up the\Ndifference in later events?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.42,0:14:25.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, ladies and gentlemen, let's\Nhave another big round of applause!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.18,0:14:27.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure enough, Shirley's\Nthe favorite to win.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.28,0:14:30.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we'll take a quick break\Nso the ladies can get changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.44,0:14:33.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But don't go far, because the special\Nskill demonstrations are up next.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.02,0:14:36.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo, we need you for just a few seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.42,0:14:38.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry, it won't take long, promise.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.70,0:14:40.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.56,0:14:42.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We probably don't...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.52,0:14:46.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, we don't stand a\Nchance against Shirley,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.26,0:14:48.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but there's nothing that we can\Ndo about it all by ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.80,0:14:51.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look, we know that this is\Nasking you for a great deal,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.48,0:14:55.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but do you carry any products\Nthat could make us more appealing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.32,0:14:56.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Anything, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.70,0:14:59.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's not like there are no options,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.80,0:15:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we don't have time to do\Nthis for all three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.98,0:15:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have a plan, but not enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.84,0:15:09.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have an idea, but there's\Nnot enough of something?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.70,0:15:11.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Like tools? Too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.32,0:15:12.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then is there not enough time?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.00,0:15:13.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:14.12,0:15:17.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does that mean there's not enough time to\Napply whatever it is to all three of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.78,0:15:18.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hello there.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.10,0:15:21.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If that's it, then you\Ntwo should do it, not me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.94,0:15:25.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, if either of you wins it,\NI will still get the prize regardless.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.56,0:15:26.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Um, Shui, are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.82,0:15:28.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.10,0:15:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have your heart set on taking\Nfirst place way more than I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.06,0:15:33.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mm-hmm. It's a deal. Thanks, Shui.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.92,0:15:36.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Loxo, please, I'll do\Nanything to win anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.76,0:15:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not confident, to be\Nhonest, but I'll do what I can.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.76,0:15:42.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Form change!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.96,0:15:45.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A cosmetics vending machine!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.68,0:15:48.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.50,0:15:50.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ever since the three of\Nthem decided to enter,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.84,0:15:54.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have been reading fashion\Nmagazines at night and practicing my
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.46,0:15:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,makeup skills to figure out what\Nlooks people will like the best.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:57.66,0:15:58.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But make no mistake,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.10,0:16:02.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I bought all this stuff in the\Nname of my vending machine fandom.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.38,0:16:06.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, it's time to make these\Ntwo shine with my new skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.70,0:16:11.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voxo's new vending machine power!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.94,0:16:14.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makeup!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.00,0:16:22.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Voxo's new vending machine power!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.76,0:16:26.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Makeup!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.54,0:16:35.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bobso!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.24,0:16:39.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gentlemen, thanks\Nfor your patience today!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.10,0:16:41.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's time for the\Nspecial skills demonstration.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.60,0:16:43.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,First up, number one, Akkui!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.94,0:16:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Take it away, girly!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.66,0:16:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,High-speed coin sorting,\Ngold, silver, and copper.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.50,0:16:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Gold, copper, silver,\Nsilver, copper, gold, gold!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:54.32,0:16:57.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Secret Rite, mixing a high mega potion!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.80,0:16:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.52,0:17:00.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Speed eating!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.94,0:17:02.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the food!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.24,0:17:03.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.18,0:17:14.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Here we go, boys!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.12,0:17:26.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So I and Kiko, you didn't\Nreally do anything themselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.18,0:17:27.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next, it's Shui's turn, finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.02,0:17:31.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How's she gonna dress, and what\Nkind of archery will she do?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.70,0:17:32.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.61,0:17:34.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's wearing a gym outfit?
Dialogue: 1,0:17:33.11,0:17:36.49,sign_Arial,text,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H363438&\3c&HF5F5F5&s\shad0\bord4\fs30}Shui
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.52,0:17:36.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That would've been my very last guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.62,0:17:38.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That outfit looks easy to move around in.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.96,0:17:42.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've never seen that outfit before,\Nbut it kinda seems just right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.08,0:17:43.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, it's hard to put my paw on it,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.94,0:17:47.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but something about that getup\Nreally does draw the eye.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.64,0:17:56.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think this might be the\Nbest crowd response so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.98,0:17:58.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, moving on.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.40,0:18:01.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pulumi and Llamas are appearing\Nas a team of two today.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.46,0:18:03.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Show us what you can do, girls.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.16,0:18:10.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pulumi,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.07,0:18:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never thought you'd take this approach,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.82,0:18:15.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and I'm surprised by how\Nwell it works for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.86,0:18:19.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Llamas pulled off the blazer look.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.10,0:18:23.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is, this is undeniably super cute.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.82,0:18:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It seems Hulemy is going to\Nunveil her new magic item.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.78,0:18:29.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's see what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.18,0:18:32.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, it's ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.64,0:18:34.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Activate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.36,0:18:45.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo-hoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.66,0:18:46.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now we lift!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.10,0:18:49.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, don't!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.22,0:18:55.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.76,0:18:58.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, no, no! I'm coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.68,0:19:03.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They got the crowd going the most.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.20,0:19:06.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'd like to think that the\Noutfits and makeup helped too.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.60,0:19:10.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now the moment you've all been\Nwaiting for, our final entry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.98,0:19:17.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mom, do I really have to read this?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.10,0:19:20.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg your pardon, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.98,0:19:24.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I do apologize, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.14,0:19:29.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shirley has fallen ill and we'll\Nhave to withdraw from the running!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.48,0:19:32.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.28,0:19:34.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I hope she's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.68,0:19:37.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I never imagined Shirley would drop out.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.74,0:19:40.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now there's really no\Ntelling who will win.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.80,0:19:45.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess we can only wait for the result.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.40,0:19:47.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't wait to see who wins.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.12,0:19:48.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just all so exciting.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.68,0:19:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh? Shirley?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.86,0:19:51.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, too bad.
Dialogue: 1,0:19:50.41,0:19:59.96,sign_2664_34_Megumi_Natural_W,text,0,0,0,,{\fs25\c&H9B6444&\3c&HDFE5ED&}Kocha Kadan
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.30,0:19:54.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, but I am better now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.72,0:19:57.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It is too bad that I had to\Nwithdraw partway through.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.04,0:19:58.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.95,0:20:00.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for the drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.08,0:20:03.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's odd, but she seems\Nhealthy enough to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.22,0:20:05.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What if...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.34,0:20:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll hold a little Boxxo.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.00,0:20:09.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You be the judge.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.48,0:20:11.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:11.52,0:20:12.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is just speculation.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:13.26,0:20:15.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But maybe Shirley only ever\Nsaid she was going to be
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.04,0:20:19.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in the contest to get people\Nmore excited about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:19.34,0:20:20.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.80,0:20:22.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't mention it.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.34,0:20:25.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, voting has officially ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.36,0:20:27.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we can do now is wait for the result.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.16,0:20:30.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavy doesn't care about\Nanything but shoes,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.26,0:20:33.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so I wonder if he really had\Nany interest in this at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.44,0:20:35.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Proved first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.70,0:20:36.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, let's see.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.44,0:20:38.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Personally,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.35,0:20:40.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think Director Origins'\Nbright red boots are
Dialogue: 0,0:20:40.34,0:20:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stunning enough to win first place\Non their own. Too bad! It's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.08,0:20:46.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Heavy never wavers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.24,0:20:49.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ladies and gents, once again,\Nthank you for being so patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.88,0:20:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it is finally time\Nto announce the winner.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.48,0:20:54.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, here it comes.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.30,0:20:58.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, let's find out who our champion is.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.60,0:21:06.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The honorable winner of the Clear Flow Lake\NStratum Dungeon Goddess Grand Prix is...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.34,0:21:07.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Envelope, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.82,0:21:10.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She's perky, but don't forget\Nher super strength. Folks.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.84,0:21:11.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's Lammis!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.68,0:21:14.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You did it, Lamas!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.34,0:21:20.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really did it, Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.10,0:21:25.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And now we present the\Nchampion, Lamas, with her prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.36,0:21:30.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, you win 50 meal tickets\Nfrom your favorite guy, Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.58,0:21:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And this totally gorgeous magic item\Ncourtesy of Suorries Corporation.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.54,0:21:38.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those boots, finally.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.90,0:21:42.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I finally found them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.50,0:21:44.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What does he mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.50,0:21:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is there something up with those boots?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.82,0:21:53.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxxo!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.73,0:21:55.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I won first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.38,0:21:57.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I'm going to eat time! Pass out!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.20,0:21:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Congratulations!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.42,0:22:03.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But something's come up that we\Nshould do before we celebrate.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.34,0:22:05.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why, how do you do, Miss Suori?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.60,0:22:06.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Heavy.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.62,0:22:07.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:07.78,0:22:10.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I accompany Boxxo in his\Ntravels hunting monsters
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.62,0:22:12.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and exploring the dungeon with the others.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.98,0:22:15.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you for your courtesy and decorum.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.26,0:22:17.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My name's Suori. Nice to meet you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.46,0:22:21.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With all that out of the way,\Ntell me, what may I do for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.32,0:22:25.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, I'd like to ask about the boots\Nyou provided for the first place prize.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.00,0:22:28.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lamas, would you please show them to us?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.20,0:22:29.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Of course, here.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.22,0:22:32.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The shape, size, quality.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.18,0:22:35.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure enough, there can be no mistake.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.04,0:22:39.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is my suspicion correct that\Nthese are the untiring god's feet?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.98,0:22:42.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My, you're a real footwear connoisseur.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.34,0:22:44.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They are one of the\Nmasterpieces of Logdium,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.62,0:22:47.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,a master craftsman renowned\Nfor their shoemaking skills.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:47.90,0:22:49.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yes, just as I thought.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.74,0:22:54.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I may, I should like to inquire\Nwhere you obtained these boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.62,0:22:57.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, we'd be happy to share. Yes, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:57.32,0:22:59.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your father said that he\Nprocured those boots during
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.64,0:23:02.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of his trips to the\NScorching Sand Stratum.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.08,0:23:06.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I recall him being rather elated, as\Nthey were a considerably rare find.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.84,0:23:07.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.12,0:23:10.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Scorching Sand Stratum, you say.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.74,0:23:12.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you very much for your answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.66,0:23:15.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.66,0:23:25.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I sold lots of alcohol at last\Nnight's Grand Prix wrap party.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:25.88,0:23:28.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Soup with basket clams\Nwill be in demand today.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.64,0:23:30.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Boxo! It's Hevee!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.28,0:23:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have you seen Heavy today?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:32.98,0:23:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shui's sorrowful cry seemed\Nto signal that our brief
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.40,0:23:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time of fun and leisure\Nhad come to an abrupt end.
Dialogue: 1,0:23:37.51,0:23:40.05,sign_2040_26_The_Vending_Mach,text,0,0,0,,{\fs14\an1\pos(254,304)\fade(425,1)}Next Time
